R["oh__@jhinaria"]="{['TS']=1758431549,['Version']=1774,['Key']='oh__@jhinaria',['na']={[104]={['N']='Underwater Adventure',['C']=1.012000,['O']=19951,['D']='Come explore the walk through Aquarium then take a dive below for an underwater adventure!  Sunken treasures and a few surprise inhabitants await!',},[28]={['N']='Santa\\'s Workshop',['C']=1.022000,['O']=20072,['D']='Santa is hard a work, making his list and checking it twice in his cozy gingerbread workshop!  ',},[2]={['N']='Tinker\\'s Library',['C']=1.025000,['O']=20245,['D']='Simple Tinker\\'s workshop ',},[44]={['N']='Hobbit Hole',['C']=1.020000,['O']=20132,['D']='\"In a hole in the ground, there lived a hobbit.  Not a nasty, dirty, wet hole....nor yet a dry bare sandy hole with nothing in it to sit down on or to eat: it was a hobbit-hole, and that means comfort.\"  -JRT\\n\\nWelcome to my Shire Mr. Tolkien',},[60]={['D']='Arrrgh, picture this, ye salty dog: a hidden grotto carved deep beneath a jagged cliff, where the sea roars like a beast, crashin’ ‘gainst the stone with fury. High above, clingin’ to the cliffside like barnacles, lies a crooked village of shanties and rope bridges, where scallywags and sea-dogs make their home. But the real prize lies above -a glitterin’ hoard of doubloons, cursed trinkets, and ancient relics, guarded by our fiercest crew...and the bones of those fool enough to try their luck',['C']=1.015000,['O']=20352,['N']='Pirate\\'s Grotto',},[45]={['N']='Kaleidoria Keep',['C']=1.020000,['O']=20218,['D']='In the heart of a forgotten valley, Kaleidoria Keep lays hidden behind veils of mist and walls of whispering ivy. Its towers shimmer with every color ever known and perhaps some that have no names at all. This is the home of Lysira, the Sorceress of Rainbows. Lysira is not like other mages of the realm. While many conjure fire, bend shadows, or command storms, she weaves light itself into spells.  Her magic from color - emotion, joy, grief, hope - all spun into brilliant arcs across the sky!',},[13]={['N']='Crusoe\\'s Summer Hut',['C']=1.018000,['O']=20218,['D']='For 28 years, Robinson Crusoe relied on his perserverance and crativity to survive after being shipwrecked on a remote island. He built his Summerhouse using things he scavanged from the ship and from around the island.',},[23]={['N']='Home Sweet Home',['C']=1.021000,['O']=19951,['D']='This is my first housing project and is now Home Sweet Home for me!  Completely renovated (reskinned lol) to create this three level home including a kitchen/dining area, library, and master suite.  The courtyard and balconies overlook the water and dock where Isobel is waiting to go sailing! ',},},}"
