R["oh__@berserker-beagle"]="{['TS']=1686703549,['na']={[70]={['N']='Farguard - Cliffside',['O']=19283,['D']='Home to a retired Redguard dragon hunter turned fabric merchant, this cliffside home was built in a place near to the owner\\'s heart, as it was the location where he slayed his first dragon. Now it serves as a practical shipping port for his fabric trades! This home integrates structure with complementing nature in ways to create unique and beautiful spaces and views. Just be careful to mind the Slaughterish problem!',['C']=1.007000,},[48]={['D']='Welcome to the grand manor of Folkvangr! Home to a wealthy Nord with a taste for the finer things in life, this stout manor features walled fortifications and traversible ramparts, complete with a full-time guard watch. Inside you will find a blend of refined and cozy to match the serene Autumn landscape outside, which of course comes with its own throne hall and trophy walls, like any true Nord\\'s residence should!',['O']=19522,['N']='Folkvangr',['C']=1.017000,},},['Version']=1769,['Key']='oh__@berserker-beagle',}"
