R["oh__@valreth"]="{['na']={[62]={['D']='The Dibella College of Art is open to all who wish to study or teach the Fine Arts. Open for public RP or for you to host your own RP art classes! Facilities include:\\n- Drawing & Painting\\n- Textiles\\n- Poetry & Literature\\n- Culinary\\n- Jewelry & Metals\\n- Woodworking\\n- Ceramics\\n- Floral & Landscape Design\\n- Massage Therapy\\n\\nOther On-Campus Amenities include:\\n- Dormitory & Bath\\n- Dining Hall\\n- Recreational Swimming',['C']=1.007000,['O']=19076,['N']='Artaeum Manor',},[32]={['D']='Just your average tavern and hunting lodge, located along the roadside of an area with lush trees. The atmosphere is warm and welcoming, the staff, courteous. The food and drinks are good. The bookshelves on either side of the fireplace have an assortment, varying from fictional adventure to bestiaries to aid hunters on their travels. Feel free to handwave the IC location to suit your RP needs.',['C']=1.007000,['O']=19079,['N']='Halcyon House',},},['TS']=1648476343,['Key']='oh__@valreth',['Version']=1767,}"
