R["oh__@cruise3174"]="{['Version']=1762,['TS']=1633198043,['Key']='oh__@cruise3174',['na']={[88]={['O']=18902,['C']=1.007000,['D']='Kira\\'s Magical Confectionary Cafe!\\n\\nThe first floor is open to everyone, all other floors are for invited guests only.\\n\\nKira\\'s Cafe sells a number of things.\\n\\n\\'Kritter Kookies\\' which are bugs that look and taste like jelly filled cookies and donuts but can be eaten by Bosmer and honor the Green Pact. Careful, they like to scurry!\\n\\nThere are also a number of magically enhanced baked goods, candies, elixirs, salves, soaps, and more!',['N']='Kira\\'s home and shop',},[63]={['O']=18902,['C']=1.007000,['D']='Kira\\'s Magical Confectionary Cafe!\\n\\nThe house has a Cafe, her home, and her lab.\\n\\nEntrance-First Floor- Cafe. Public to everyone. All other floors are only available to permitted guests IC.\\n\\nEntrance-Second floor- Redroom. \\n\\nEntrance-Third floor- Lab.\\n\\nEntrance-Balcony.\\n\\nMiddle junction- Kitchen.\\n\\nSecondary-First floor- Bedroom.\\n\\nSecondary-Second floor- Dining.\\n\\nSecondary-Third Floor- Attic. Entrance portal to secondary Lab.',['N']='Kira\\'s Snowglobe',},},}"
