R["oh__@halalula1234"]="{['Version']=1762,['TS']=1635728004,['na']={[89]={['N']='Blackwood Chapel',['O']=18932,['C']=1.037000,['D']='Started this game in July, this is my first notable home - Adding as I progress in the game, not completed yet!\\n\\nThis property is dedicated to the Holy Vs Unholy theme. The Chapel portion is a place of life and divine worship, including a rooftop wedding chapel, and areas dedicated to the sun, moon, & stars.\\n\\nThe Courtyard serves as a transition like the middle Earth.\\n\\nThe Castle is dedicated to evil (Vampire, Daedras, Witches, Torture, Death)',},},['Key']='oh__@halalula1234',}"
